"这个 Demo 展示 JobsOCTimer 的衍生品：UIButton+JobsTimer。适合验证码、重新发送、支付等待这类“按钮自己进入倒计时状态”的场景。页面退出时要销毁按钮内部 timer，避免离开页面后继续回调 UI。" = "This Demo shows the derivative of JobsOCTimer: UIButton+JobsTimer. It is suitable for scenarios such as verification code, resending, and payment waiting, where the button enters the countdown state by itself. When the page exits, the internal timer of the button must be destroyed to avoid continuing to call back the UI after leaving the page.";
