"这里演示 JobsOCTimerMgr 的核心用法：用 identifier 注册多个 JobsTimer，再由 Manager 统一 start / pause / resume / stopAndRemove。适合页面内有多个任务、跨组件要按名字控制 timer、或需要统一处理前后台策略的场景。" = "Here is a demonstration of the core usage of JobsOCTimerMgr: register multiple JobsTimers with identifier, and then use the Manager to unify start / pause / resume / stopAndRemove. It is suitable for scenarios where there are multiple tasks in the page, timers need to be controlled by name across components, or front and backend strategies need to be processed uniformly.";
